#   * manufactured phantom cross-language edges by NAME COLLISION, e.g.
#     caption-layout.ts appearing to call `mm()` and dpi-utils.ts appearing to
#     call `getSize()` — both actually minified symbols in this bundle, in a
#     different language, reachable from nothing.
#
# If a vendored bundle is ever added elsewhere, add it here too rather than
# letting it swamp the graph again.
